#: c434b97384cc4a999721b96e28ae9b21
msgid "Using NTRIP correction service:  If you are going to operate in areas with reliable internet connection and NTRIP service coverage, follow `Tutorial on sending NTRIP corrections to ArduPilot. <https://www.ardusimple.com/send-ntrip-corrections-to-ardupilot-with-missionplanner-qgroundcontrol-and-mavproxy/>`_  If you are not aware of NTRIP service provider in your area, we have prepared the `List of RTK correction service providers in your country. <https://www.ardusimple.com/rtk-correction-services-in-your-country/>`_"
